   "source": [
    "算术平均 Arithmetic Mean\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\bar{x} = \\mu = \\frac{1}{n}\\sum_{i=1}^n x_i\n",
    "$$\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "f849c1dc",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "几何平均 Geometric Mean\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\bar{x} = (\\prod_{i=1}^n x_i)^{\\frac{1}{n}}\n",
    "$$"
   ]
  }
 ],
